nciation":["수ː학"]},{"id":"2c81182794f85e98","term":"과제","zh":"课题，作业","audio":"/audio/2c81182794f85e9873c5.mp3","entryId":"18308","definition":"公司或学校交给的事情或应该解决的问题。","pronunciation":["과제"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/27623be52e3945b7c686.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n18308-1-7-2","ko":"이 연습 문제를 공책에 모두 풀어 오는 거야.","zh":"要把这些练习题全部做在笔记本上然后带过来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"연습","meaning":"练习","explanation":"연습：练习","readings":[{"term":"연습","audio":"/audio/3906aa577b0627036d72.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92041","senseId":"1","lemma":"연습","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연습","audio":"/audio/3906aa577b0627036d72.mp3"}},{"text":"문제를","meaning":"题，问题","explanation":"문제：题，问题；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"문제","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66246","senseId":"1","lemma":"문제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"문제를","audio":"/audio/8af57ae2549d94f339ad.mp3"}},{"text":"공책에","meaning":"笔记本","explanation":"공책：笔记本；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"공책","audio":"/audio/06bbecd00d0929ecc83f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15252","senseId":"1","lemma":"공책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공책에","audio":"/audio/da431251a3726f0f4264.mp3"}},{"text":"모두","meaning":"全部，所有","explanation":"모두：全部，所有","readings":[{"term":"모두","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64739","senseId":"1","lemma":"모두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모두","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3"}},{"text":"풀어","meaning":"解开，解答","explanation":"풀다：解开，解答；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"풀다","audio":"/audio/cada9014a11f228c9dfe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29761","senseId":"5","lemma":"풀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"풀어","audio":"/audio/5a537899b7ec8fb4557b.mp3"}},{"text":"오는","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오는","audio":"/audio/204311ae50badf5e3adb.mp3"}},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"所说的事情（说明作业内容）","explanation":"거 是 것 的口语形式，后接 이다 的非敬语形 거야；这里用于说明作业内容。它包含名词化结构，不能把整个 거야 当作单独的语尾。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"3906aa577b062703","term":"연습","zh":"练习","audio":"/audio/3906aa577b0627036d72.mp3","entryId":"92041","definition":"为干好某事反复做到熟练。","pronunciation":["연ː습"]},{"id":"bc0fca46ae9a4879","term":"문제","zh":"题，问题","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3","entryId":"66246","definition":"要求解答的题目。","pronunciation":["문ː제"]},{"id":"06bbecd00d0929ec","term":"공책","zh":"笔记本","audio":"/audio/06bbecd00d0929ecc83f.mp3","entryId":"15252","definition":"可以写字或画画，用白纸或划线纸系成的本子。","pronunciation":["공책"]},{"id":"2576dfb09ecb81b9","term":"모두","zh":"全部，所有","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3","entryId":"64739","definition":"一个不剩或一个不漏的全体。","pronunciation":["모두"]},{"id":"cada9014a11f228c","term":"풀다","zh":"解开，解答","audio":"/audio/cada9014a11f228c9dfe.mp3","en